d 'RMSTPATH': module to calculate differences in restricted mean survival time (RMST) between two independent groups
d
d  The command estimates and visualizes differences in restricted
d mean survival time (RMST) between two independent groups using
d unadjusted Kaplan–Meier survival estimates. It allows users to
d evaluate RMST differences across multiple prespecified follow-up
d horizons while generating a continuous RMST difference trajectory
d that incorporates the observed event times. 
d
d KW: survival data
d KW: survival time
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261030
d
d Author:  Christina Laternser ,  Ann & Robert H. Lurie Children’s Hospital of Chicago
d Support: email christina.laternser.research@@gmail.com
d
f rmstpath.ado
f rmstpath.sthlp
